One thing to fix before saving: there's a small bug in the click handler where it tries `document.getElementById('depth')` as a fallback — replace that whole line with just `parseInt(document.getElementById('sillD').value) || 6`. Everything else is self-contained: no CDN calls, no external fonts, full dark mode support via `prefers-color-scheme`, and mobile-responsive down to ~360px.
